<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">30082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Sixty-five billion barrels of Venezuelan oil changed hands on Friday, transferred to United States control under a deal signed in Washington.</s> <s>What Caracas lost isn't only ownership of the reserves — it's the authority to decide which foreign creditor gets paid from the state oil company's cash flow, a power that survives whoever governs next.</s> <s>Venezuelans call it the price of January's capture of President Maduro, and the agreement names no date for democratic restoration.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Sudan's war has become a drone war, and the numbers now say so plainly: the American envoy Massad Boulos told the Security Council that drones account for nearly eighty percent of casualties in Sudan this year.</s> <s>On the twentieth of August, Sudanese military drones struck a convoy of hundreds of Rapid Support Forces vehicles inside Chad's Ennedi region — vehicles assembled over weeks in southeastern Libya and routed through Chadian territory into North Darfur.</s> <s>Washington wants the two thousand five Darfur arms embargo extended nationwide to name drones explicitly, but Russia and China have both pushed back, and either can veto it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Ethiopia, the Amhara insurgency has allied with the Tigray People's Liberation Front — the force it fought in a war that killed hundreds of thousands between twenty twenty and twenty twenty-two.</s> <s>Fano leader Zemene Kassie says eight armed groups have joined against the federal government, united not by ethnicity but by a shared demand about the multinational federal system and the constitutional right to self-determination.</s> <s>Tigray's regional government warns of another catastrophic war, and Addis Ababa's counter-charge should be weighed the same way — both are parties to this, and neither is a referee.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A drone strike hit a warehouse in Bucha, Ukraine, and the warehouse — not the drone — flattened around fifty nearby homes.</s> <s>Between twenty-seven and thirty-seven people died, and prosecutors say the explosives were stored in a residential district in Myla, in a country whose own law bans keeping ammunition near housing.</s> <s>The investigation now has to ask a question Kyiv would rather not face during a war: who authorized the storage.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Off the coast of Puntland, a ten-day joint Turkish and Somali operation retook a hijacked vessel and killed fourteen alleged pirates.</s> <s>It's the first large kinetic use of Turkey's twenty twenty-four maritime pact with Mogadishu — Ankara trains the Somali army, runs a base in the capital, and is permitted to patrol Somali waters, which is why the flag doing the shooting was Turkish rather than European.</s> <s>No court will try the accusations against the dead, so what those fourteen men were is now a claim without an evidentiary record.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Berlin is preparing to blame Russia for an attempted drone attack near a cargo plane at Leipzig airport, and to answer it with national sanctions rather than European ones.</s> <s>A national list needs no unanimity, which is precisely the workaround for the holes that Belgium and Hungary have left in European Union policy — and a drone leaves so little forensic evidence that naming a state is a political decision, not a laboratory one.</s> <s>Moscow denies it, and the announcement is expected before the Saxony-Anhalt vote.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Poland's National Institute of Telecommunications recorded interference across every satellite navigation frequency on sixty-three percent of days in the first nineteen days of August at its Gdańsk station.</s> <s>Signals from twenty thousand kilometres up arrive weaker than a receiver's own thermal noise, so a modest local transmitter can erase them — knocking out city bikes, municipal fleets, drones, and the aviation and maritime systems that make the Baltic a live safety problem.</s> <s>Warsaw gave <sub alias="the International Civil Aviation Organization">ICAO</sub> evidence pointing to Russian territory last year, and the interference hasn't stopped.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A judge in San Jose struck down the American policy of revoking student visas over criticism of Israel's war on Gaza.</s> <s>Judge Noel Wise's finding is the precedent that matters — the State Department's theory was that a visa is a discretionary privilege, so it could be withdrawn to punish speech the government couldn't otherwise ban.</s> <s>It's a district ruling, not settled law, and the administration can appeal.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Inside Gaza's ceasefire, which has held on paper since October, three Palestinians were killed and seven wounded on Saturday, and the Israeli army said it struck a Hamas commander inside a hospital compound.</s> <s>No arbiter has the power to suspend the agreement, so each strike is logged as a violation and the arrangement simply continues — which makes this a framework for managed killing rather than an end to one.</s> <s>The UN hasn't said whether it will investigate the hospital strike.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A new attribution study finds that more than forty percent of the world's children under ten — around five hundred and eighty million of them — already face at least twenty extra heat-stress days a year because of human-caused warming, more than any other age group.</s> <s>The measure is wet-bulb temperature, and it matters because the body cools by evaporating sweat: above roughly twenty-eight degrees wet-bulb the evaporation stops working, so a humid thirty-three degrees is deadlier than a dry forty.</s> <s>South Asia, southeast Asia and west Africa carry the heaviest childhood exposure — young, growing populations whose children contributed least to the emissions doing it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saudi construction hiring is slowing sharply as the Vision twenty-thirty giga-projects are quietly scaled back.</s> <s>Hiring is the honest indicator, because a kingdom can restage a groundbreaking but it can't fake a payroll — and the workforce absorbing that adjustment is overwhelmingly migrant labour from Pakistan, Bangladesh, India, Nepal and the Philippines, often working against debt taken on at home to pay recruitment fees.</s> <s>A slowdown in Riyadh is a remittance shock in Punjab and Sylhet, landing on households that never had a claim on the project's upside.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan apologized for night-time blackouts after a missed liquefied natural gas cargo left a three thousand six hundred megawatt hole in the grid at peak evening demand.</s> <s>Shipments from Qatar through the Strait of Hormuz have been disrupted by the American-Iranian war, which is the same dollar-denominated dependency behind the country's stalled electric vehicle target — refiners are weighing a six billion dollar upgrade to process imported crude, while fuel companies keep building pumps and not chargers.</s> <s>Two-wheeler assembly, the cheapest thing to electrify, rose forty-three percent to two point four million units this year, and almost none of it went electric.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Moody's upgraded Nigeria as foreign reserves hit a twenty-year high on Friday.</s> <s>The reserves grew because the naira float and the end of fuel subsidies compressed imports and household spending — meaning the upgrade lowers Abuja's borrowing costs, not the cost of living that produced it.</s> <s>Nigeria's next eurobond will show whether the market agrees, God willing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazil's Bank Master collapsed into a fraud investigation, with depositors and the deposit-guarantee fund absorbing what regulators didn't catch.</s> <s>The central bank blocked a rescue sale in September — five months after the first signs of fraud surfaced, a gap that is itself the finding.</s> <s>Police have asked for two more months.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Kolwezi, in the Democratic Republic of the Congo, ninety-eight percent of hourly air readings breach World Health Organization limits, and one thousand five hundred students breathe that air daily, less than five hundred metres from mine waste.</s> <s>Cobalt is priced on the London Metal Exchange, and that price carries no line for the tailings its extraction leaves behind — the cost sits with Lualaba's lungs instead of the battery's balance sheet.</s> <s>Kinshasa hasn't responded to the research.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers melted a diamond and, for the first time, reproduced in a laboratory the process thought to make it rain diamonds inside Neptune and Uranus.</s> <s>The ice giants' mantles are rich in hydrocarbons, and under enough pressure the hydrogen is stripped away and the carbon crystallises, so diamonds form and sink — releasing gravitational heat as they fall.</s> <s>That may answer why Neptune radiates more heat than it receives from the Sun, though this mimics the process rather than measuring the planet.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's artificial intelligence data-centre boom is winning cheap land, power and tax concessions from willing state governments, and the communities moved off that land are getting nothing back.</s> <s>The asymmetry is arithmetic: a hundred-megawatt facility employs a few hundred permanent staff, so investment and employment aren't the same argument — and the land was valued as farmland while being converted into the substrate of a trillion-dollar industry.</s> <s>The displaced then compete with the facility for water and for firm power in a grid that still load-sheds.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American immigration enforcement is buying robot dogs for its raids, with no published rules on what the machines record.</s> <s>Homeland Security frames the purchase as officer safety, which is the usual doorway through which military hardware enters domestic policing.</s> <s>Boston Dynamics has said little about where its machines end up.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>